  "spec": "TOWN_BOARD",
  "version": "1",
  "status": "TB-1 empty boards and live reports. Hearthmoor and Fernbrook squares. No slips.",
  "_about": "Ours, not a design copy. Applied last, after civic. Props face up. The player reads a board from the tile south of it. Report lines are TEMP copy (see _placeholders) until the designer signs them (D49). Slips and bounties stay empty. Sprites are copied from data/town_board_art.json.",
